WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:02.669
Here I go!

00:00:03.461 --> 00:00:05.672
-What are you doing?
-Get it together!

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:07.674
When the new term started,

00:00:07.757 --> 00:00:13.596
Rikako was a bit of a sensation
with us simple country boys.

00:00:14.472 --> 00:00:17.934
Hey Taku, check out the girls!

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:19.477
Ariga, right?

00:00:23.815 --> 00:00:25.066
You can do it!

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.110
I know, they're big.

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:29.487
No! The far court!

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:33.491
Do it!

00:00:57.515 --> 00:00:58.975
She's really cool.

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:01.102
She just beat the tennis club captain!

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:03.938
She's really something!

00:01:04.022 --> 00:01:07.317
She plays like a pro!

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:10.195
Tokyo kids can really hit the ball!

00:01:10.278 --> 00:01:12.822
-She stands out.
-Nice legs too!

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:15.450
Bet that type's hard to handle.

00:01:17.827 --> 00:01:20.955
Rikako really stands out, huh?

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:24.292
I don't know why you'd say that.

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.087
Hey, Yutaka!

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:38.681
Sorry.

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:42.519
Rikako's out of place in class.

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:46.439
I think it's because
she stands out too much.

00:01:46.731 --> 00:01:48.525
Out of place, huh?

00:01:48.817 --> 00:01:50.527
Yeah... in lots of ways.

